message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Phytospectra — a phytointelligence platform for NMR–MS natural products analysis"
abstract: >-
  Phytospectra unifies NMR spectroscopy, mass spectrometry, and metabolomics
  into a single agentic workflow: a complex plant extract goes in; ranked,
  evidence-graded structural and biological hypotheses come out.
